Backport the doorway cleanup test correction from:
https://github.com/tox-dev/filelock/commit/008e3c3e55b7051230a1e9d3af9e94e6afe8624c

Inject the competing claim once the owner's held claim exists, instead of
counting scandir calls. Reopen the directory to see the inserted claim.

diff --git a/tests/test_strict_soft_failures.py b/tests/test_strict_soft_failures.py
